<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51113" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσό-πεδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of even surface,
			level</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἰ. χωρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VC</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. τῷ δέρματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.1011
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. χρώματα</span>
			<i>flat in appearance</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῖλα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat.,
				<i>level</i> or <i>even with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῦν ποιέων τῆ ἄλλῃ γῇ ἰσόπεδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.201
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
